        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fridayharbor.com/historic",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Each May, Friday Harbor celebrates National Historic Preservation Month with guided tours, talks, and special events at the historical museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fridayharbor.com/historic",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Friday Harbor lies in a rain shadow created by the Vancouver Island Ranges and the Olympic Mountains, making it drier than nearby areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
